  "prefLabel": "Rev 2907.05 Lien Priority",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2907.05 Lien Priority. Pursuant to RSA 21-J:8, II, the department’s liens shall take first priority over all other liens except first and second mortgages.\n\nSource. #10680, eff 10-2-14; ss by #13660, eff 6-21-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev2900.html"
